            <a data-template="toc:highlight-current" class="hsg-current" href="/historicaldocuments/frus1946v07/comp4">Greece:</a>
            <ul class="hsg-toc__chapters__nested">
               <li class="hsg-toc__chapters__item">
                  <a data-template="toc:highlight-current" class="hsg-current" href="/historicaldocuments/frus1946v07/ch9">Participation by the United States in the Allied Mission to observe the
